  "description": "Apex triggers and classes that read or write CaseMilestone records: completing milestones, detecting violations, reacting to SLA state changes. Trigger keywords: CaseMilestone trigger, auto-complete milestone Apex, milestone violation polling, CompletionDate write pattern. NOT for entitlement auto-association or assignment rules in a Case trigger \u2014 use apex/case-trigger-patterns. NOT for entitlement process and milestone setup in Setup \u2014 use admin/entitlements-and-milestones.",
